"**1、畅享剧集**：订阅生效后，所有 **[DramaPlayfun]** 系列节目均可畅享观看，有效期内不限观看次数。" = "**1. Unlimited viewing:** An active subscription gives you unlimited access to all **[DramaPlayfun]** shows for the duration of your subscription.";
"**1、金币用途**：充值获得的虚拟“金币”仅限在本 App 内解锁付费短剧剧集使用，无现金价值，**不支持提现、转让、转赠或在非本 App 渠道交易**。" = "**1. Coin usage:** Purchased virtual coins can only unlock paid short-drama episodes in this app. They have no cash value and **cannot be withdrawn, transferred, gifted, or traded outside this app**.";
"**2、到账时效**：金币充值成功后通常立即到账。如遇网络延迟，请尝试重新启动 App 或在个人中心联系客服。" = "**2. Delivery:** Coins usually arrive immediately after a successful top-up. If there is a network delay, restart the app or contact support from your profile.";
"**2、自动续费**：本订阅采用自动续费方式。若未取消，系统将在当前订阅到期前 **24 小时内**，自动从您的绑定账户扣取下一期费用，续费价格与当期价格一致。" = "**2. Automatic renewal:** Unless canceled, your subscription renews automatically. Your linked account will be charged for the next period within **24 hours before the current subscription expires**, at the same price as the current period.";
"**3、退款政策**：鉴于虚拟数字化商品的特殊属性，**金币充值一旦成功即代表服务已完成，除法律明确规定外，不予退款**。" = "**3. Refund policy:** Because coins are virtual digital goods, **a successful top-up completes the service and is nonrefundable except where required by law**.";
"**3、随时管理**：您可随时管理或取消自动续订。如不再续订，请**至少提前 24 小时**操作：**iOS 路径**：通过“设置 > [您的 Apple ID] > 订阅 > [DramaPlayfun]”关闭。" = "**3. Manage anytime:** You can manage or cancel auto-renewal at any time. To stop renewal, cancel **at least 24 hours in advance**. On **iOS**, go to Settings > [Your Apple ID] > Subscriptions > [DramaPlayfun].";
