"2. **观看记录清除：** 您的追剧历史、收藏列表、点赞数据将被永久删除。" = "2. **Watch history erased:** Your watch history, favorites, and likes will be permanently deleted.";
"3. **帐号关系解除：** 帐号绑定关系及个人资料将全部清空。" = "3. **Account links removed:** All linked accounts and personal information will be deleted.";
"4、**有效期限制**：直接充值购买的金币**永久有效**；通过每日签到、任务活动等方式获赠的“赠送金币/体验金币”可能存在有效期，过期将自动失效，请优先使用。" = "4. **Expiration:** Purchased coins **never expire**. Bonus or trial coins earned through daily check-ins, tasks, or promotions may expire automatically. Use these coins first.";
